@startuml state-update
!include _style.iuml
title Update stages (UpdateService.Status.Stage)

[*] --> Unavailable : dev run /\nsideloaded build
[*] --> DisabledByPolicy : InAppUpdates = 0
[*] --> UpToDate

UpToDate --> Checking : timer / Check for updates
Checking --> UpToDate : nothing newer
Checking --> Ready : newer, already staged
Checking --> Downloading : newer, silent download allowed\n(or the user's opt-in under the Store policy)
Checking --> Available : newer, consent needed\nor notice only
Available --> Downloading : Download\n(Store consent dialog)
Downloading --> Ready : staged
Downloading --> Failed : error
Downloading --> Available : canceled
Failed --> Checking : Try again
Ready --> Installing : Restart to update /\nidle install / quit
Installing --> [*] : Windows closes and\nrestarts the app
Installing --> Ready : switch failed (1st)
Installing --> ManualStepsNeeded : switch failed (2nd)
@enduml
